IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nla-dates`
IMPORT `nla-rules`
IMPORT `nla-seat`

-- Limitation Act 1981 (NT) -- worked cases for the claimant's questions (nla-seat.l4), the date helpers (nla-dates.l4)
-- and the two regulative rules (nla-rules.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text; none was
-- copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law.
-- The facts are illustrative.
-- UNOFFICIAL. Copyright in Northern Territory legislation is owned by the Northern Territory. BASELINE ENCODING. Not for
-- public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`
`nd` MEANS `d` 1 1 2000
`PI` MEANS `damages for personal injury`
`tort` MEANS `another action in tort, including breach of statutory duty`
`contract` MEANS `an action on a contract not evidenced by a deed`
`deed` MEANS `an action on a deed`
`statute money` MEANS `an action to recover money recoverable under an enactment`
`FIA` MEANS `a Compensation (Fatal Injuries) Act 1974 action for a death`
`defam` MEANS `defamation`
`land etc` MEANS `land, a mortgage, a trust, an account, a judgment, a penalty, an arbitration award, admiralty, goods, equity or tax`

GIVEN `y` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`last day` `y` MEANS `the last day to commence is` `y`

-- An adult (born 1 January 1950) with no other facts, and the three flags (another Act, child abuse, dust disease).
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of action`, `other Act` IS A BOOLEAN, `abuse` IS A BOOLEAN, `dust` IS A BOOLEAN, `accrued` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`flags limit` k `other Act` `abuse` `dust` `accrued` MEANS
    `By when must I commence my action` k `other Act` `abuse` `dust` `accrued` (`d` 1 1 1950) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of action`, `accrued` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`adult limit` k `accrued` MEANS `flags limit` k FALSE FALSE FALSE `accrued`

-- A claimant born on a day, who may have died.
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of action`, `accrued` IS A DATE, `born` IS A DATE, `died` IS A BOOLEAN, `died on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`minor limit` k `accrued` `born` `died` `died on` MEANS
    `By when must I commence my action` k FALSE FALSE FALSE `accrued` `born` `died` `died on` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd`

-- An adult (born 1 January 1950) with another disability, perhaps ended, a notice to proceed, a death.
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of action`, `accrued` IS A DATE, `began` IS A DATE, `ended` IS A BOOLEAN, `ended on` IS A DATE, `notice` IS A BOOLEAN, `notice on` IS A DATE, `died` IS A BOOLEAN, `died on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`disabled limit` k `accrued` `began` `ended` `ended on` `notice` `notice on` `died` `died on` MEANS
    `By when must I commence my action` k FALSE FALSE FALSE `accrued` (`d` 1 1 1950) `died` `died on` TRUE `began` `ended` `ended on` `notice` `notice on` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd`

