§§ `Dates`

-- 3 years from 10 March 2020 end with 10 March 2023; from 29 February 2020 with 28 February 2023 (fork F1); one year
-- before 10 March 2023 is 10 March 2022; 6 months after 31 August 2025 is 28 February 2026 (fork F1), after 15 January
-- 2026 is 15 July 2026, after 31 July 2026 is 31 January 2027; 56 days after 25 August 2026 is 20 October 2026 (6 + 30
-- + 20).
#ASSERT `the anniversary` 3 `years after` (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS `d` 10 3 2023
#ASSERT `the anniversary` 3 `years after` (`d` 29 2 2020) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2023
#ASSERT `the anniversary` (-1) `years after` (`d` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `d` 10 3 2022
#ASSERT `the date` 6 `months after` (`d` 31 8 2025) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `the date` 6 `months after` (`d` 15 1 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 7 2026
#ASSERT `the date` 6 `months after` (`d` 31 7 2026) EQUALS `d` 31 1 2027
#ASSERT `the date` 56 `days after` (`d` 25 8 2026) EQUALS `d` 20 10 2026

§§ `s 4 -- person under a disability`

#ASSERT `Am I a person under a disability` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a person under a disability` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I a person under a disability` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I a person under a disability` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `s 5A -- child abuse`

#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` TRUE `sexual abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` TRUE `serious physical abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` TRUE `psychological abuse arising from sexual or serious physical abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` TRUE `other abuse or harm` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` TRUE `sexual abuse` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` TRUE `sexual abuse` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my claim a child abuse action with no limitation period` FALSE `sexual abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 12(3) -- dust disease`

#ASSERT `Is my illness a dust disease` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my illness a dust disease` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my illness a dust disease` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `The time limit -- Part II periods for an adult`

-- s 12(1): 3 years for personal injury, other torts, contracts and statutory money; s 14: 12 years on a deed; s 17: 3
-- years from the death; s 12(2)(b): 1 year from publication.
#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 10 3 2023)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `tort` (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 10 3 2023)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2022)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `deed` (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2031)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `statute money` (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2022)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `FIA` (`d` 5 5 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 5 5 2024)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `defam` (`d` 1 9 2025) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 9 2026)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 29 2 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 28 2 2023)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `land etc` (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`

-- s 5: another Act's period. s 5A: child abuse, including a death claim (s 5A(4)). s 12(2)(a): dust disease, but a death
-- claim from a dust disease keeps s 17's 3 years (finding 4).
#ASSERT `flags limit` `PI` TRUE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `another Act's time limit applies`
#ASSERT `flags limit` `PI` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 7 1975) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `flags limit` `FIA` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `flags limit` `PI` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `flags limit` `FIA` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 5 5 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 5 5 2024)

-- s 9(2): a cause of action that arose before 26 February 1982 (the day before, and the day itself).
#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 25 2 1982) EQUALS `section 9 decides, for a cause of action that arose before 26 February 1982`
#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 26 2 1982) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 26 2 1985)

§§ `s 36 -- infancy`

-- Born 1 June 2010, injured 1 June 2020 (aged 10). Suspended 2922 days to the 18th birthday on 1 June 2028 (8 years with
-- 29 February 2024 and 2028): 1 June 2023 + 2922 days = 1 June 2031; 3 years after 1 June 2028 is also 1 June 2031.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2031)
-- A deed, accrued at 17 years 6 months (1 December 2027): 183 days suspended (31 + 31 + 29 + 31 + 30 + 31); 1 December
-- 2039 + 183 days = 1 June 2040, later than 3 years after the birthday (1 June 2031).
#ASSERT `minor limit` `deed` (`d` 1 12 2027) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2040)
-- Defamation published at 17 (1 June 2027): 366 days suspended; 1 June 2028 + 366 = 2 June 2029; s 36(1)(e) extends to
-- 3 years after the 18th birthday, 1 June 2031.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `defam` (`d` 1 6 2027) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2031)
-- The child dies on 1 January 2022 while under 18: suspended 579 days (365 + 214); 1 June 2023 + 579 = 31 December 2024;
-- 3 years after the death is 1 January 2025, the later.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2025)
-- Injured the day of turning 18 (1 June 2028): not an infant then, so the ordinary 3 years.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2028) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2031)
-- Injured the day before turning 18: 1 day suspended, 31 May 2031 + 1 = 1 June 2031; 3 years after 1 June 2028 is 1 June
-- 2031, the later.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 31 5 2028) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2031)

§§ `s 36 -- another disability (incapacity or imprisonment), s 38 notice to proceed, death, 30-year cap`

-- Adult injured 1 March 2020 (ordinary last day 1 March 2023).
-- Incapable 1 March 2021 to 1 March 2022 (365 days): 1 March 2023 + 365 = 29 February 2024; 3 years after 1 March 2022 is
-- 1 March 2025, the later.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) (`d` 1 3 2021) TRUE (`d` 1 3 2022) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2025)
-- Imprisoned from 1 January 2021 to 1 January 2023 on a deed accrued 1 January 2020: 730 days; 1 January 2032 + 730 =
-- 31 December 2033 (2032 a leap year), later than 1 January 2026.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `deed` (`d` 1 1 2020) (`d` 1 1 2021) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2023) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 12 2033)
-- A disability beginning after the period expired (1 June 2023) has no effect.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) (`d` 1 6 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2024) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2023)
-- One beginning on the last day (1 March 2023) and ending 1 April 2023: 31 days to 1 April 2023; 3 years after the end,
-- 1 April 2026.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) (`d` 1 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 4 2023) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 4 2026)
-- A disability that has not ended: suspended up to the 30-year cap, 1 March 2050.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) (`d` 1 3 2021) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2050)
-- s 38: incapable from accrual, notice to proceed served 1 July 2021: 487 days (365 + 122); 1 March 2023 + 487 = 30 June
-- 2024; 3 years after 1 July 2021 is 1 July 2024, the later.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) (`d` 1 3 2020) FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 7 2021) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2024)
-- Death while incapable (1 January 2030): 3593 days suspended; 1 March 2023 + 3593 = 31 December 2032; 3 years after the
-- death is 1 January 2033, the later.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) (`d` 1 3 2020) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2030) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2033)
-- s 36(4): a deed accrued 1 January 2020 with a disability to 1 January 2045: the suspension would run to about 2057, so
-- the cap of 30 years from accrual, 1 January 2050.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `deed` (`d` 1 1 2020) (`d` 1 1 2020) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2045) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2050)

-- Both spells: born 1 June 2010, injured 1 June 2020; incapable 1 January 2025 to 1 June 2030. Infancy brings the last
-- day to 1 June 2031; the other spell counts only from 1 June 2028 (730 days to 1 June 2030): 1 June 2031 + 730 = 31 May
-- 2033; 3 years after 1 June 2030 is 1 June 2033, the later.
#ASSERT `minor and disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) (`d` 1 1 2025) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2030) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2033)
-- Born 1 January 2010, a deed accrued 1 January 2011, imprisoned from 1 January 2030 and still: the 30-year cap,
-- 1 January 2041.
#ASSERT `minor and disabled limit` `deed` (`d` 1 1 2011) (`d` 1 1 2010) (`d` 1 1 2030) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2041)

§§ `ss 42, 43 -- fraud, concealment, mistake`

#ASSERT `fraud limit` `contract` (`d` 1 1 2020) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `time has not yet begun to count`
#ASSERT `fraud limit` `contract` (`d` 1 1 2020) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2025)
#ASSERT `fraud limit` `contract` (`d` 1 1 2020) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2019) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2023)

§§ `s 41 -- confirmation, in the time limit`

-- Contract accrued 1 July 2019, last day 1 July 2022. Confirmed 1 March 2021: 3 years from then, 1 March 2024. On the
-- last day: 1 July 2025. The day after: too late, 1 July 2022.
#ASSERT `confirmed limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 3 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2024)
#ASSERT `confirmed limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
#ASSERT `confirmed limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 2 7 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2022)

§§ `s 39(3) -- Public Trustee order`

-- Born 1 June 2010, injured 1 June 2020 (last day otherwise 1 June 2031). An order on 1 January 2030: 3 years, 1 January
-- 2033, the later. An order on 1 January 2025: 1 January 2028, so 1 June 2031 stands.
#ASSERT `order limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) (`d` 1 1 2030) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2033)
#ASSERT `order limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) (`d` 1 1 2025) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2031)

§§ `s 44AA -- concerns notice`

-- Published 1 September 2025; last day 1 September 2026. The Act's example: notice 7 days before (25 August), 6 days
-- left, 50 days: 21 October 2026. 56 days before (7 July): 55 left, 1 day: 2 September 2026. 57 days before (6 July): no
-- extension. On the last day: 56 days, 27 October 2026. Published 1 August 2025, before s 44AA commenced: no extension.
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 9 2025) TRUE (`d` 25 8 2026) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 21 10 2026)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 9 2025) TRUE (`d` 7 7 2026) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 2 9 2026)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 9 2025) TRUE (`d` 6 7 2026) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 9 2026)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 9 2025) TRUE (`d` 1 9 2026) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 27 10 2026)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 9 2025) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 9 2026)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 8 2025) TRUE (`d` 25 7 2026) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 8 2026)

§§ `Commencing on a day -- the regulative rule`

-- Adult injured 10 March 2020, last day 10 March 2023.
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 10 3 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 11 3 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 9 3 2020) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `PI` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 10 3 1975) (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `contract` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2010) (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `land etc` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 1 1 2021) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `adult can commence` `PI` TRUE FALSE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 1 1 2021) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The minor injured at 10: in time on 1 June 2031, out of time on 2 June 2031.
#ASSERT `minor can commence` (`d` 1 6 2031) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `minor can commence` (`d` 2 6 2031) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 41 -- the confirmation question`

`written` MEANS `a written acknowledgment of my right, signed by its maker`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `written` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2021) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `the period counts afresh from` (`d` 1 3 2021)
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `a payment in respect of my right` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2021) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `the period counts afresh from` (`d` 1 3 2021)
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `written` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 7 2022) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `the period counts afresh from` (`d` 1 7 2022)
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `written` TRUE TRUE (`d` 2 7 2022) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `too late: the limitation period had already expired`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `an acknowledgment not in writing or not signed` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2021) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `this is not a confirmation that binds the person I would sue`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `a notice to proceed under section 38 or 39` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2021) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `this is not a confirmation that binds the person I would sue`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `written` TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2021) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `this is not a confirmation that binds the person I would sue`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgment or payment restart my time` `written` FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2021) (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2022) EQUALS `this is not a confirmation that binds the person I would sue`

§§ `s 44 -- the court's general power`

`may extend` MEANS `the court may extend the time, to the extent and on the terms it thinks fit`
`no extension` MEANS `this section gives no extension on these facts`
-- Last day 10 March 2023. Facts learnt 11 March 2022 (within the last 12 months), action 11 March 2023 (the anniversary
-- of learning): may extend if just. Learnt 10 March 2022 (a full year before): not within, no (ii): none. Learnt 1 June
-- 2023, action 2 June 2024 (after the anniversary): none. Not just: none. Ground (ii) and just: may extend. Not material:
-- none.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 11 3 2022) (`d` 11 3 2023) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `section 44 does not apply to defamation`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 11 3 2022) (`d` 11 3 2023) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `there is no limitation period to extend`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2023) FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `may extend`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 11 3 2022) (`d` 11 3 2023) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `may extend`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 10 3 2022) (`d` 11 3 2022) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no extension`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2023) (`d` 1 6 2024) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `may extend`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2023) (`d` 2 6 2024) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no extension`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 11 3 2022) (`d` 11 3 2023) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no extension`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 1 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `may extend`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2023) TRUE (`d` 11 3 2022) (`d` 11 3 2023) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no extension`

