§§ `s 39 -- notice to a parent or guardian (the second regulative rule)`

`complied` MEANS `the notice was complied with`
`not complied` MEANS `the notice was not complied with: the person you would sue may ask the Supreme Court to appoint the Public Trustee as your tutor`
-- Served 31 August 2025: 6 months end 28 February 2026 (fork F1). Brought that day: complied; 1 March 2026: not. Brought
-- 15 January 2026: complied. Already brought (1 August 2025): complied.
#ASSERT `By when must my parent or guardian bring my action under the notice` (`d` 31 8 2025) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `By when must my parent or guardian bring my action under the notice` (`d` 15 1 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 7 2026
#ASSERT `Did my parent or guardian comply with the notice` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 28 2 2026) EQUALS `complied`
#ASSERT `Did my parent or guardian comply with the notice` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS `not complied`
#ASSERT `Did my parent or guardian comply with the notice` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 15 1 2026) EQUALS `complied`
#ASSERT `Did my parent or guardian comply with the notice` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 1 8 2025) EQUALS `complied`

§§ `s 8 and s 24 -- answering a claim`

#ASSERT `When is my counterclaim taken to be commenced` (`d` 3 4 2024) EQUALS `d` 3 4 2024
-- Liability fixed 1 June 2024. Principal period ended 1 January 2021: 4 years end 1 January 2025, earlier than 1 June
-- 2026. Principal period ended 1 January 2023: 4 years end 1 January 2027, so 1 June 2026. No principal period: 1 June
-- 2026 (fork F7).
#ASSERT `By when must I sue for contribution` (`d` 1 6 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2021) EQUALS `d` 1 1 2025
#ASSERT `By when must I sue for contribution` (`d` 1 6 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2023) EQUALS `d` 1 6 2026
#ASSERT `By when must I sue for contribution` (`d` 1 6 2024) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `d` 1 6 2026

§§ `ss 53-55 -- child abuse claims decided before 15 June 2017`

`may sue anew` MEANS `I may sue despite the earlier judgment or settlement, as if the earlier action had not been commenced`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `nothing: no earlier action, judgment or settlement` EQUALS `I may sue: section 5A applies directly`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `a judgment that the limitation period had expired` EQUALS `may sue anew`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `a judgment for legal professional negligence on the ground that the period had expired` EQUALS `may sue anew`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `a judgment finally deciding the matter on other grounds` EQUALS `I cannot sue again: a court finally decided the matter on other grounds`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `a settlement made because the claim was out of time` EQUALS `may sue anew`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `a settlement made for other reasons` EQUALS `the Act does not clearly say`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` TRUE `an action started before 15 June 2017 and still undecided then` EQUALS `section 5A applies to my pending action`
#ASSERT `Can I sue now on my child abuse claim decided before 15 June 2017` FALSE `a judgment that the limitation period had expired` EQUALS `not a child abuse action`

#ASSERT `Can this court set aside the earlier judgment` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can this court set aside the earlier judgment` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can this court set aside the earlier judgment` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can this court set aside the earlier judgment` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
